                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dca87270-62e2-30ce-ade9-1ed5dd0ec895",
                        "entry_id": "91b2a3c5-eee9-34c6-bc5f-5d1f3b9bcbb6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A distinguishing feature which marks a species off from other members of the same genus."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bcebd90-65f0-48d6-aaa6-09752f3702bd",
                                "sense_id": "dca87270-62e2-30ce-ade9-1ed5dd0ec895",
                                "text": "That character, it seems to me, should be regarded as the practically important differentia of religion for our purpose; and just what it is can easily be brought out by comparing the mind of an abstractly conceived Christian with that of a moralist similarly conceived."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90bfbca0-90ea-4b89-83d3-646d32023dc2",
                                "sense_id": "dca87270-62e2-30ce-ade9-1ed5dd0ec895",
                                "text": "If genera are different and co-ordinate, their differentiae are themselves different in kind. Take as an instance the genus ‘animal’ and the genus ‘knowledge’. ‘With feet’, ‘two-footed’, ‘winged’, ‘aquatic’, are differentiae of ‘animal’; the species of knowledge are not distinguished by the same differentiae."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "17d90347-f099-4d54-92e7-7553db90bb30",
                                "sense_id": "dca87270-62e2-30ce-ade9-1ed5dd0ec895",
                                "text": "In the case of a word like “surfboard,” the differentiae seem pretty clear. How is this board different from all other boards?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
